hi all,

If we want to avoid both "large changes" and "unnecessary public APIs", anoth=
er option is to introduce a nested @InterfaceAudience.Private class inside th=
e @InterfaceAudience.Public class. I previously shared an example of this app=
roach here: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21337#discussion_r3574009798

The advantages are straightforward, and the only downside is that users must =
understand what the word "Internal" means. Fortunately, I have high confidenc=
e in most developers' vocabulary :)

Best,
Chia-Ping

