sanghyeok An created KAFKA-20884:
------------------------------------

             Summary: Consider kafka-streams-groups.sh supporting classic streams application.
                 Key: KAFKA-20884
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20884
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: sanghyeok An
            Assignee: sanghyeok An


Currently, kafka-streams-group.sh supports only Streams applications that use the Streams group protocol.

Considering KAFKA-20172, during an online migration, Streams group members and classic Streams members can coexist in the same group. In this situation, it might be helpful for kafka-streams-group.sh to support both Streams group members and classic Streams members.

https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20172



