Hi Matthias,
Thanks for your response.

I feel that I should point out that it is possible to access the application-=
level record headers in the broker, but it's not at all convenient because of=
 compression. We went to great lengths in the share group DLQ code to ensure =
that we safely decompressed record batches for copying to the DLQ, and there =
are cases where we intentionally skip records because they would decompress t=
o an ill-advised extent consuming a lot of broker memory.

Thanks,
Andrew

