Content-Type: text/plain;
	charset=utf-8

Hey all,
I=E2=80=99d like to start the discussion for proposal, KIP-789: Use =
localhost:9092 as default bootstrap-server/broker-list in client tools.

After this KIP, user can use client tools such as =
kafka-console-consumer.sh without specifying bootstrap-server, this was =
deactivated for a long time waiting for the total removal of zookeeper =
and legacy client tools.

Detailed information can be found here:
=
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=3D1913354=
33

Any comments and feedback are welcome.

Thank you.
Deng Ziming.=

