We started to implement KIP-1238 and public API changes for TDD landed, how=
ever, the feature is not completed.

Thus, we should revert the public API changes before 4.4.0 is release, to a=
void unnecessary API deprecation noise for users.

[https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/22892]
[https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/22673]
