Hi all,

KIP-1357 has passed the vote. During the implementation, however, I made a
change to one of its public interfaces that I wanted to call out before the
change lands.

Specifically, GroupSpec#configs() will now return a new AssignmentConfigs
interface instead of Map<String, String>;:

@InterfaceAudience.Public
@InterfaceStability.Evolving
public interface AssignmentConfigs {
    int numStandbyReplicas();
    List<String>; rackAwareAssignmentTags();
}

Please take a look and let me know if you have any concerns with this
change.
Best,
Gabriella

