Hi,

it seems we are still not having a 4.4 branch, almost 2 weeks after 
feature freeze, with code freeze being set for Aug/12.

Does this mean that there is delays in code freeze deadline, too? Not 
sure why the release branch was not cut right after feature freeze...

It's overall a little bit confusing. Would be good to get some clarify 
from RM side.

Thanks


-Matthias


