----------------------------------------

             Summary: Introduce new versions of all other RPCs using request header v3
                 Key: KAFKA-20925
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20925
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Andrew Schofield
            Assignee: Andrew Schofield


For all RPCs except GetTelemetrySubscriptions, PushTelemetry and SaslHandshake, introduce new versions which use request header v3. For interbroker RPCs, use a new metadata version to gate use of the new RPCs. Do not do the optimisation for client ID and client instance ID omission yet.



