hi Jos=C3=A9

Actually, we did NOT extend the code freeze :)

The only commits we are pushing to the 4.4 branch right now are to revert
incomplete KIPs.

KAFKA-16517 is a kind of performance optimization, right? If so, it doesn't
seem necessary for 4.4.0.

Please correct me if I am wrong.
Best,
Chia-Ping

