> Hi Chia-Ping,
>
> Thanks for volunteering to release 4.4. Since we extended the code
> freeze to Aug 19th, I would like to include KAFKA-16517 in the 4.4
> release.
>
> Do you agree? Can I cherry pick the commit
> (https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/22805) to the 4.4 branch?
>
> Thanks,
> -Jos=C3=A9
