Hi everyone,

I would like to start the voting thread for KIP1362.

This KIP fixes a compatibility gap for supporting node replacements during
all phases of KRaft migrations.

Discussion thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/bq27on99lf5b24d16zt5g5hnysd30c3w
KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/440303727/KIP-1362+Add+a+rollback-compatible+storage+format+option+for+KRaft+migration

BR,
Anton

