nnect/runtime/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/connect/runtime/AbstractHerder=
.java#L1077] Apparently the configValue can be null.=C2=A0
> Looking at github, apparently some clean-up was done in this area, maybe =
it's related, maybe not: [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20393]
> h1. Additional observations
> h2. Observation 1
> The debezium field that causes trouble is "database.out.server.name". Thi=
s field is only a deprecated alias as shown here: [https://github.com/debez=
ium/debezium/blob/main/debezium-connector-oracle/src/main/java/io/debezium/=
