Pasting the analysis of the security tool
{quote}The constructor=C2=A0
{code:java}
PerMechanismData(
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 ScramMechanism mechanism,
=C2=A0 =C2=A0 String configString
){code}
mishandles confidential information in line 145
{code:java}
