Hi all,

I'd like to start the vote for KIP-1349.

This KIP allows configurable snapshot frequency (from a records-based to a
bytes-based configuration) for share groups.

KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/421958844/KIP-1349+Bytes-based+configurable+snapshot+frequency+for+share+groups

Discussion thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/lpwmfgq28lz8ghzyb0wp8s8o4zpgw2tc

Thanks,
Murali

