Hi,

To address all the scenarios:

1. We can start to emit the records with a key.
2. Tombstone records can be sent behind a feature flag.
3. For new __remote_log_metadata topic, it can be created with the compact
cleanup policy.
4. For clusters with existing __remote_log_metadata topic, don't change the
policy automatically, it is upto the operator to change it when required.
(No change from user perspective)
5. Provide an external script to safely migrate the __remote_log_metadata
topic to compact.

--
Kamal

