Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hi all,

Thanks again for the discussions on this feature. I wanted to provide a
small update on some additional behavior for this feature and its
motivation, which can be found here:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/406623954/KIP-1312+S=
upport+unregistering+controllers#KIP1312%3ASupportunregisteringcontrollers-=
AdditionalChanges.
Essentially, https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20865 makes it so
none of the KRaft voters can be unregistered. The initially proposed
behavior was only the active controller could not be unregistered.

Best,
Kevin Wu

