Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-20977)
  RemoteCopyLagSegments/RemoteCopyLagBytes report a phantom lag of 1 on
 low-throughput partitions (single-record segments)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
