Subject: [DISCUSS] KIP-1305: Per-Record Context Processing for Kafka Consumers
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="00000000000007454d0659fafd6c"
From: "Yury Gribkov via dev" <dev@kafka.apache.org>
