Hello everyone. I'd like to start voting on KIP-1027: Add
MockFixedKeyProcessorContext and TestFixedKeyRecordFactory.

This KIP proposes updates to kafka-streams-test-utils. It adds
MockFixedKeyProcessorContext to allow testing a FixedKeyProcessor and
adds TestFixedKeyRecordFactory to allow creating a new FixedKeyRecord.

KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/294816709/KIP-1027+Add+MockFixedKeyProcessorContext+and+TestFixedKeyRecordFactory

Discussion Thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/0s6dbxtwpgq70yfkhv72f297x92blh0s

JIRA: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15143


Thanks,
Christopher Moyer

