Luke Chen created KAFKA-20996:
---------------------------------

             Summary: `InetAddress.getHostName` could take long to impact network thread
                 Key: KAFKA-20996
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20996
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Luke Chen


We use `InetAddress.getHostName` in some places in kafka, but we never consider it might take long time to respond because it performs a reverse hostname lookup. When this happens, it'll block the network thread and cause unexpected timeout and hard to troubleshoot. We should improve this behavior.



--
