Mickael Maison created KAFKA-20997:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Support running in FIPS environments
                 Key: KAFKA-20997
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20997
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Mickael Maison
            Assignee: Mickael Maison


The default SSL engine factory implementation statically loads a KeyFactory for the DSA algorithm at startup. This prevents brokers from stating in FIPS environments where DSA is not available.

Instead of failing at the key factory creation, broekrs should ignore key factories that can't be loaded (just log a message) and only fail if a key requires a factory that wasn't loaded.



--
