Hi Federico,

Thanks for the responses. Not sure about RS25, but you mentioned you are
looking into it again, so will wait for the response after that. For RS27,
 not supporting unclean leader election for older clients may be ok unless
the fix is straightforward. The rest of the responses sound good.

