Subject: [DISCUSS] Release managers for 4.3.2 and 4.2.2
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="0000000000001bee8f065a5ab10c"
From: Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>
