--0000000000001bee8f065a5ab10c
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi all,

We have accumulated a number of fixes on the 4.3 and 4.2 branches, so it
may be a good time to start planning the 4.3.2 and 4.2.2 bugfix releases.

Would any committer like to volunteer as release manager for either
version? It's a great way to help Kafka cluster maintainers stay ahead of
bugs and security issues, and also a good opportunity to get familiar with
the release process.

If there are no volunteers, Ken and I are happy to serve as the RMs for
both versions.

Thanks,
Chia-Ping

--0000000000001bee8f065a5ab10c--

